	</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>

<div class="section2">
	<div class="main_container">
		<div class="work_container">
			<div id="aboutsic"></div>
			<h1 class="main_title">Samsung Innovation Campus 2026</h1>
			<div class="common_text">
				The next-generation technologies of Artificial intelligence (AI) and Machine Learning (ML) are already reshaping the world we know today, presenting consumers, businesses, governments, and societies with many valuable benefits – even impacting the way we will interact virtually. Our course will cover the necessary content, tools and applications needed to place you ahead of the curve.
			</div>
			<div class="common_text">
				At Samsung, we are preparing for the new world and want to help you acquire the knowledge and tools to do the same. We’re bringing the latest edition of our signature Artificial Intelligence (AI) course that will not just enhance your skillset, but will provide you with a mentorship program & connectivity with industry leaders, to enhance your career prospects.
			</div>
			<!--<div class="common_text">
				Enroll today to see how your future will unravel.
			</div>-->
			<div class="trans_btn">
				<a href="https://mena.samsung.com/pk/Samsung_Innovation_campus" data-omni-type="microsite_course" data-omni="pk:innovation campus:register now for innovation campus" target="_blank">Register now</a>
				<!--<a href="https://mena.samsung.com/qa/Samsung_Innovation_campus" data-omni-type="microsite_course" data-omni="pk:innovation campus:start your course" onclick="return alert('By clicking OK you agree to our terms and conditions on this page below. Please click Ok to continue...');" target="_blank">Apply Here</a>-->
				<!--<a href="https://innovationcampus.thinkific.com/users/sign_in" data-omni-type="microsite_course" data-omni="pk:innovation campus:start your course" onclick="return alert('By clicking OK you agree to our terms and conditions on this page below. Please click Ok to continue...');" target="_blank">Start your course</a>-->
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>

<div class="section3 blue_bg">
	<div class="main_container">
		<div class="work_container">
			<!--<div class="counter_title">Registration ends in</div>
			<div class="auto_counter">
				<div class="counter_box">
					<div class="digits days" id="days"></div>
					<div class="digits hours" id="hours"></div>
					<div class="digits seconds" id="seconds"></div>
					<div class="clear"></div>
				</div>
			</div>-->
			<!--<div class="common_text">This free course is available with limited seats. <br>Registration ends on 7th November 2021. <br>All applicants must complete all steps in the admissions process.</div>-->
			<div class="session_details">
				<ul>
					<li>
						<div class="session_title">Eligibility</div>
						<div class="session_desc">20-30 years old university graduates and second to last & final year students/ under-employed/ un-employed youth/ Pakistani Nationals & Residents / Course pre-test will be conducted on acceptance / Basic understanding of Statistics, Object-Oriented Language and Syntax (Java, JavaScript & C++) / Admission Test</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<div class="session_title">Schedule</div>
						<div class="session_desc">Application deadline: 11<sup>th</sup> January, 2026.<br>Course Duration:  19<sup>th</sup> January  to 11<sup>th</sup> April 2026<br>(Course duration might vary if any unforeseen circumstances arise)</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<div class="session_title">Venue</div>
						<div class="session_desc">Physical sessions in Lahore, Karachi & Islamabad (based on location of the candidate)</div>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<!--<div class="trans_btn">
				<a href="/content/dam/samsung/pk/innovation_campus/images/SIC_SEPAK_AI_Course_Schedule_2022_Cohort_2_v2.pdf" data-omni-type="microsite_course" data-omni="pk:innovation campus:check course schedule" target="_blank">Check course schedule</a>
			</div>-->
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>

<div class="section4">
	<div class="main_container">
		<div class="work_container">
			<div id="whythiscourse"></div>
			<h2 class="sub_title">Why this course?</h2>
			<ul class="course_details slider">
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_1_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">We are offering you a course which focuses on both the theory and practice of AI – both machine and deep learning.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<!--<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="/content/dam/samsung/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_2_v2.png" alt="Icon" /></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You can do it from the comfort of anywhere you want, through our seamless e-learning experience, and a mixed format of live interactive sessions and working offline at your own pace.</div>
					</div>
				</li>-->
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_3_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You will have the chance to engage with other like-minded students and instructors.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_4_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You will receive a certificate from the Samsung Innovation Campus upon passing the course.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<!--<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="/content/dam/samsung/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_5_v2.png" alt="Icon" /></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You will be taught by a world class data science expert.</div>
					</div>
				</li>-->
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/why_icon_6_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">All learning materials will be provided for free.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>

<div class="section5">
	<div class="main_container">
		<div class="work_container">
			<div id="coursehighlights"></div>
			<h2 class="sub_title">Course highlights</h2>
			<ul class="course_details slider">
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_1_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You will be able to learn AI modeling on a concrete foundation of mathematics.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_2_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">Understand the basic concepts of probability, statistics, linear algebra, and python.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_3_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">Our curriculum will help you to understand the use case of ML tools and real-world problem solving with various exercises and practical projects.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_4_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">You will develop a fluid understanding of AI projects, gaining practical experience in the design, implementation, and results communication processes.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_5_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">Grasp the landscape of data science tools and their applications.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
				<li>
					<div class="detail_box">
						<div class="icon_box"><img src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/innovation_campus/images/2024_assets/course_icon_6_v2.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$" alt="Icon"/></div>
						<div class="course_copy">Learn the process of designing, implementing, and communicating project results.</div>
					</div>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>

<div class="pattern_bg">
	<div class="section6">
		<div class="main_container">
			<div class="work_container">
